      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi @{69683486f85d59c66dd62cdd|full_name}! Thank you for the request.\n\nHow does the 50 listing limit currently affect you?\n\nWorld stores are limited to 50, which effectively limits the number of **instant** listings you can use to 50.\n\nHowever, temporary listings and permanent listings do not need to be published in a world store, and you can have an unlimited number of them.",
