      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}\n\nIs the 50-listing limit only for listings displayed in the world store UI?\n\nFor permanent listings, if I use Udon to allow users to purchase them directly within the world, do I no longer need to add those listings to the world store?\n\nCan I use this method to offer more than 50 listings and process purchases normally?",
