  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It seems that the number of listings that can be added to a single world store is currently limited to 50.\n\nIs there any way to increase this limit?\n\nFor worlds that offer a large variety of purchasable items, 50 listings may not be enough.\n\nWould it be possible to increase this limit to 100 or more, or allow creators to request a higher limit?\n\nThank you!",
